#! watchtower - a platform on four legs with a bell and a good view of the road
#! Top-heavy so the eye goes to the lookout. Only two highlight runs in the whole
#! tile - the roof edge and the rail top - because a structure with light on
#! every surface reads as a diagram. Legs are solid body, braced; the bell hangs
#! under the platform with one glint, and that is the detail that says watch.
